===Verb===
{{en-verb|upraises|upraising|upraised}}

# {{context|archaic|lang=en}} To [[raise]] something up; to [[elevate]].
#* '''1596''', Edmund Spenser, ''The Faerie Queene'', IV.i:
#*: So fell those two in spight of both their prydes, / But Scudamour himselfe did soone '''vprayse''', / And mounting light his foe for lying long vpbrayes.
# {{context|archaic|lang=en}} To [[move]] something [[upright]]; to [[erect]].

